---
---

<section id="historia" class="py-24 bg-[#FDFBF7] dark:bg-[#181614] relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">

      <!-- Visual Image Grid -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 relative">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <div class="space-y-4">
            <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-[#EAE3D2] dark:border-[#332E2A] shadow-md">
              <img
                src="/images/gallery/taller-2.jpg"
                alt="Detalle artesanal de resina"
                loading="lazy"
                decoding="async"
                class="w-full h-64 object-cover hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
              />
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-[#EAE3D2] dark:border-[#332E2A] shadow-md">
              <img
                src="/images/gallery/taller-4.jpg"
                alt="Proceso de pintura a mano"
                loading="lazy"
                decoding="async"
                class="w-full h-44 object-cover hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
              />
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-4 pt-8">
            <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-[#EAE3D2] dark:border-[#332E2A] shadow-md">
              <img
                src="/images/gallery/taller-5.jpg"
                alt="Adorno terminado de resina"
                loading="lazy"
                decoding="async"
                class="w-full h-44 object-cover hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
              />
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-[#EAE3D2] dark:border-[#332E2A] shadow-md">
              <img
                src="/images/gallery/taller-6.jpg"
                alt="Taller de arte Marys Arts"
                loading="lazy"
                decoding="async"
                class="w-full h-64 object-cover hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
              />
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Emotional Narrative Copywriting -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-6 text-left">
        <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#C86D51] font-semibold">
          Nuestra filosofía de hogar
        </span>

        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-serif font-bold text-[#332E2A] dark:text-[#FDFBF7] leading-tight">
          No decoras una casa. <span class="italic text-[#C86D51] font-normal">Creas un hogar.</span>
        </h2>

        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-[#665E55] dark:text-[#C5BCB1] font-light leading-relaxed">
          Creemos fielmente que los espacios donde habitamos no deben ser fríos o impersonales. Un verdadero hogar se construye con <strong>pequeños detalles</strong> que despiertan serenidad, cuentan una historia y abrazan con calidez a quienes cruzan su puerta.
        </p>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-6 pt-4 border-t border-[#EAE3D2] dark:border-[#332E2A]">
          <div class="space-y-2">
            <h3 class="font-serif font-semibold text-lg text-[#332E2A] dark:text-[#FDFBF7]">Paz y Bienestar</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-[#82786E] dark:text-[#A89F93] leading-relaxed">
              Formas suaves y paletas orgánicas diseñadas para brindar calma a tu día a día.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-2">
            <h3 class="font-serif font-semibold text-lg text-[#332E2A] dark:text-[#FDFBF7]">Familia y Recuerdos</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-[#82786E] dark:text-[#A89F93] leading-relaxed">
              Piezas concebidas para acompañar momentos inolvidables en el centro de tu vida.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-4">
          <a
            href="https://wa.me/50660367249?text=Hola%20Marys%20Arts!%20Me%20encanta%20la%20filosof%C3%ADa%20de%20sus%20piezas,%20quisiera%20informaci%C3%B3n."
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center text-sm font-semibold text-[#C86D51] hover:text-[#B35C41] group"
          >
            <span>Descubre la magia de cada pieza</span>
            <svg class="ml-2 w-4 h-4 transform group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3"></path>
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
